rules.description:
During the Deployment step place a Cooldown Token on Preston Cole's Command Card, the CHOOSE ONE of the following;
-Before deploying any Battle Groups select any ONE Battle Group to be held in Reserves, regardless of whether the scenario calls for it. During any of the Reserves arrived step remove the Cooldown Token on Preston Cole's Command Card to automatically bring in the pre-selected Battle Group, deploying it ANYWHERE on the Board. The Battle Group may then continue its activation as normal, though no Boarding Craft may be launched by it.
-Once Per Game, instead of activating a Battle Group normally, remove the Cooldown Token from Preston Cole's Command Card to redeploy ONE unactivated Battle Group ANYWHERE on the Battlefield by executing a Slipspace Jump. The Selected Battle Group needs to be in coherency and can face any direction. The Battle Group may then continue its activation as normal, though no Boarding Craft may be launched by it.
